        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.4.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kul 4:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele Elisha muntu wa-Leza, naakamvwa kuti mwami wa-Israyeli wazapaula­ zyakusama zyakwe, wakatumina mwami mulazyo wakuti, Nkaambonzi wazapaula zyakusama zyako? Aze okuno kulindime, azibe kuti musinsimi mpali munyika ya-Israyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Naamani wakeza amabbiza aakwe ankalaki zyakwe, waima amulyango waŋanda ya-Elisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.4.41"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bam 4:41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.9.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joh 9:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Elisha wakamutumina mutumwa, wakati, Koya ukasambe ziindi zili musanu azibili mu-Jordano, elyo nyama yako iyoosanduka, uyoosalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.2.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 2:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele Naamani wakanyema, wainka, wati, Ncobeni ndali kuyeeya kuti ulazwida anze kundibona, ulaimikila, ulakwiilila izina lya-Leza wakwe, ulavukuzya ijanza lyakwe atala azilonda akuponya cinsenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
