            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JAS.1.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jak 1:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sa Abana a-Faripara, milonga yaku-Damasko, tiili kabotu kwiinda meenda oonse aa-Israyeli na? Sa nsikonzyi kusamba mulinjiyo akusalala? Elyo wakapiluka, wainka cabukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino balanda bakwe bakamuswenenena, bakati, Taata! Musinsimi naakakwaambila kuti ucite imwi milimo mipati, sa nowatakacita? Lino sa tokonzyi kucita eci ncaamba cakuti, Samba, usalale? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.4.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 4:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo wakaya, walinika mumaanzi aa-Jordano ziindi zili musanu azibili, mbubonya mbwaakaamba muntu wa-Leza, Nkabela nyama yakwe yakasanduka, yaba mbuli nyama yamwana muniini, aboobo wakasalazigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
