              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Naamani wakati, Mbowakaka, lino mebo ndemulanda wako mpegwe mukuli wambongolo zyobile wevu, nkaambo ndemulanda wako nsikooyoocita limbi zipaizyo niziba zituuzyo kumizimu imbi cita kuli-Jehova luzutu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
