        },
        {
          "text": "Gehazi mulanda wa-Elisha muntu waLeza wakati, Bona! Simalelo wangu wamufwida insoni, oyu mu-Aramu Naamani, kukukaka cipo ncaakaleta. Ncobeni Jehova mbali muumi, ndafwambaana kumutobela, nkatambule cintu kulinguwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aboobo Gehazi wakazuzaana akutobela Naamani, nkabela Naamani naakamubona uleza buzuzaana, wakaseluka kuzwa munkalaki akumuswana, wati, Sa kuli kabotu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakavuwa kuti, Kuli kabotu, Simalelo wangu wandituma, wati, Kwandisikila lino lino balombe bobile, bana babasinsimi, bazwa kucilundu ca-Efraimu, Ubape italenta lyansiliva, azyakusama zyobile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Naamani wakati, Sa tokonzyi kuzumina kutambula matalenta obile? Nkabela wakamusungilizya, waanga matalenta obile aansiliva munkomo zyobile azyakusama zyobile, waaba mumaanza aabalombe bakwe bobile, nkabela bakamusololela baliziyumwide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino naakasika kukalundu, wakazitambula kuzwa kumaanza aabo, wazibamba muŋanda. Mpawo wakabapilusya bantu, baya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
